<title>USA: Access Beyond stake cut by Chilton.</title>
<headline>Access Beyond stake cut by Chilton.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York investment adviser Richard Chilton said Friday he cut his stake in Access Beyond Inc to 672,800 common shares or 5.6 percent from 7.1 percent held previously.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Chilton said his latest transactions include the sale of 177,200 common shares between January 14 and March 13 at prices ranging from $4.82 to $6.69 per share.</p>
<p>Acess Beyond, based in Gaithersburg, Md., is a maker of remote access products.</p>
